un and I am an individual Vtuber.  I saw your picture on Twitter and thought it was very nice, so I made a request.\nI would like to ask you to draw an illustration of myself for Halloween, if you don't mind.\nI know that Halloween is coming up soon, but I would appreciate it if you would accept my request.\nIf you accept, I would appreciate it if you could make it in the style of a kyonshi costume.\n\n Usage.\nUse as a thumbnail on YouTube.\nPosting on SNS such as Twitter (We will mention your Twitter account name when we use it)\n\n  Requests\nWe will leave the composition, posing, etc. to you.\nWe would appreciate it if you could provide us with PSD data.\nWe would appreciate it if you could provide us with PSD data.\n If there is a background, it would be greatly appreciated if it could be on a separate layer.\n\nWe would appreciate it if you could refer to the 3-sided drawings on the fixed tweets. I would be happy if you could draw it in a way that is easy for me to draw. https://twitter.com/akarun_melody\n\nWe apologize for the inconvenience, and thank you for your consideration.", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 46185, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "いわの", "screen_name": "iwano_29", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1970778554133815296/lMPkCG0h.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 969847, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "Calin🐧🐰新刊電子版配信開始！", "screen_name": "Calintou214", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2004876580380889088/B0oZS7yc.jpg", "header_url"